config BR2_PACKAGE_PLEXOSD
	bool "plexosd"
	depends on BR2_x86_64
	help
	  MediaLith management daemon.

	  Its first job, and the reason it exists before any management API
	  does, is the boot health gate: plexosd declares a boot good, and
	  nothing else may. Until it does, the try counter in the UKI's
	  filename stands, and three failed boots hand the machine back to
	  the previous slot (ADR-0005).

	  Built by the workspace's own Rust toolchain rather than by
	  Buildroot, for the reasons set out in package/plexos-init.
